      "writtenOn": "2022-01-27T20:36:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see, but I think it\u0027s simpler to make sure that `shared_handles_lock` is always locked when `shared_handles` is accessed. This way imo is easier to reason about.",
      "parentUuid": "8661234c_d3911efd",
      "revId": "c6426cb2e3f8865035773529e6fadf2ce65a990b",
